cert-manager Headlamp plugin

The dashboard layout follows this repository's Flux operations dashboard.
The Certificate, Issuer, ClusterIssuer, CertificateRequest, Order and Challenge
resource integrations follow the Headlamp plugin SDK's Kubernetes patterns.

Manual renewal follows cert-manager/cmctl's renew implementation: set the
Certificate Issuing condition to True with reason ManuallyTriggered via the
status subresource. https://github.com/cert-manager/cmctl/blob/master/pkg/renew/renew.go
